If no stable ID exists, generate a deterministic SHA-256 fingerprint from normalized board identity, title, official publication date, and canonical attachment URL or another validated identity field.

Do not use the current time, list position, random values, or a changing query parameter as a notice identity.

Use both stable notice identity and content hashes. A title change, attachment correction, or updated document must be recorded as a possible revision, not blindly treated as a wholly unrelated notice.

Do not silently overwrite previously recorded notice metadata.

